<title>THAILAND: Sahaviriya Steel 1996 loss higher.</title>
<headline>Sahaviriya Steel 1996 loss higher.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  loss	    2.66  vs   loss   0.37</p>
<p>    Net	   loss	1,356.90  vs   loss 189.36</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Sahaviriya Steel Industries Plc, a building and furnishing materials firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
